flowchart TD
    A([Open http://localhost:3000]) --> B[Spatial view loads]
    B --> C[Select LiveKit in center toggle]
    C --> D[Click Start Session button top-right]
    D --> E[Browser requests mic permission]
    E --> F[App fetches LiveKit token from /api/token]
    F --> G[WebRTC room connected]
    G --> H[Mic goes live — orb glows cyan]
    H --> I[Speak naturally]
    I --> J[Agent responds with audio]
    J --> K[Orb turns green while agent speaks]
    K --> H
    H --> L[Click Listening to stop]
    L --> M[Session disconnects + memory saved]